  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Health Facilities in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide safer, greener health facilities in Belize, Dominica, Grenada, Guyana, Jamaica, St Lucia and Saint Vincent and the Grenadines to deliver care in disasters, generate operational savings and reduce disaster losses and build climate resilience.</narrative>
